{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.HeckeSandwichReduces"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_bond_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_bond_letter","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L189-L199","doc":"**A letter `c • g_i + d • 1` on a generator used nowhere else contributes `c z + d`:**\n`tr (a * (c • g_i + d • 1) * b) = (c * z + d) * tr (a * b)`. At `z = 0` this is the\n`τ` statement `QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.tau_bond_letter`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_mul_g_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_mul_g_mul","kind":"theorem","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L182-L187","doc":"**The bond letter on every braided tower.** For a Markov trace with parameter `z` on a\ntower satisfying the Iwahori–Hecke relations, and `a, b` generated by the `g_t` with\n`t ≠ i`: `tr (a * g_i * b) = z * tr (a * b)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.far_of_braided","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.far_of_braided","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L179-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_mul_g_mul_of_disjointBlock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_mul_g_mul_of_disjointBlock","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L165-L171","doc":"**The bond letter, core form.** For `a, b` avoiding `g_i`,\n`tr (a * g_i * b) = z * tr (a * b)`, given far-commutation and the disjoint-block law. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_mul_g_of_mem_avoiding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.tr_mul_g_of_mem_avoiding","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L148-L163","doc":"`tr (x * g_i) = z * tr x` for every `x` avoiding `g_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.avoiding_le_belowAbove","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.avoiding_le_belowAbove","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L117-L143","doc":"`avoiding i ⊆ below i * above i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.mul_mem_belowAbove","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.mul_mem_belowAbove","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L100-L115","doc":"The submodule product `below i * above i` is closed under multiplication. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.commute_below_above","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.commute_below_above","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L91-L98","doc":"Everything below `i` commutes with everything above `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.above_le_shifted'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.above_le_shifted'","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L81-L84","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.above_le_shifted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.above_le_shifted","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L76-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.below_le_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.below_le_H","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L71-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.g_mem_shifted_of_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.g_mem_shifted_of_le","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L67-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.above","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.above","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L63-L65","doc":"The subalgebra generated by the generators strictly above `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.below","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.below","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L59-L61","doc":"The subalgebra generated by the generators strictly below `i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.avoiding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.MarkovBondLetter.avoiding","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/MarkovBondLetter.lean#L55-L57","doc":"The subalgebra generated by every generator `g_t` with `t ≠ i`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}